# Frontend ↔ API (GET)

Read `docs/api-frontend.md` before wiring home/recordings/clips/settings to the backend. Auth cookie rules: `docs/auth-frontend.md`.

- Call only through `apps/web/app/lib/api.ts` with `credentials: 'include'`.
- IDs are integers. JSON is camelCase. Times are ISO + `startMs`/`endMs` — format labels in the UI.
- Mock types (`proj_q3`, `updatedLabel`, `"41s"`) are view-models, not the API.
- Empty lists → `200 []`. Missing/not owned → `404 { "error": "Not found" }`. No cookie → `401`.
- Never render `storageKey`, real API keys, or `maskedKey` other than `"configured"` / `"not configured"`. Recording/project posters use `thumbnailUrl` (HTTPS Filestack only), same as clip cards.
- Live data: `VITE_USE_MOCK_DATA=false`. Swagger: `/docs`.
- Upload ingest: follow `.cursor/rules/upload-ingest-frontend.mdc`. `POST /api/recordings` + poll `GET /api/recordings/:id/processing`.
- Clip export: `POST /api/recordings/:id/hooks/:hookId/export` with optional `{ aspectRatio, fitMode, burnSubtitles }` (`fitMode` default `fit` = full frame + blur; `fill` = center crop), then poll `GET /api/clips/:id`. Ask moments use `POST /api/clips` with the same fields. Download `videoUrl` (HTTPS Filestack only).
- Delete: `DELETE /api/projects/:id`, `DELETE /api/clips/:id`, `DELETE /api/recordings/:id` → **204** (soft-delete `deleted_at`; lists/gets omit those rows). Confirm in UI before calling. Missing/not owned → **404**. Never render `storageKey`. Filestack + PyAI KB stay until a later purge.
